  "title": "Parent Habit Progress Aggregation",
  "description": "Implement logic to compute routine-level completion count by aggregating child habit entries per day using SIMPLE COUNT approach: count how many child habits are completed vs total children (e.g., \"3/5 habits completed\"). Returns numeric completion count (completed children) and total count for display in collapsed routine view. A child habit is considered completed if its entry value is YES_MANUAL or YES_AUTO for the given day.",
